cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or data, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "Data and code for: Two centuries of river engineering: changes in meta-ecosystem resilience and connectivity"
abstract: >-
  Code and data for the analysis of changes in functional habitat connectivity
  and meta-ecosystem resilience along a 150 km section of the Danube (Austria)
  and its floodplains between 1817 and 2022, based on a time series of habitat
  networks, reach and catchment connectivity indices, connectivity clusters and
  multilayer networks.
